  <section class="community-feat" aria-label="🤝 社区新提交">
    <div class="cf-head">
      <div class="cf-head-text">
        <span class="cf-title">🤝 社区新提交</span>
        <span class="cf-sub">社区用户主动推荐的工具：自动校验通过后进入待人工审核候选池，人工审核通过才会进入精选目录。</span>
      </div>
      <a class="cf-all" href={`/AI-Shovel-Collection/submit/`}>查看更多 →</a>
    </div>

    <div class="cf-stats">
      <span class="cf-stat" title="社区提交候选池中的工具总数（独立于自动发现候选池）"><b>{communityPool.total}</b> 社区提交</span>
      <span class="cf-stat warn" title="自动校验通过、等待人工审核"><b>{communityPool.pending}</b> 待人工审核</span>
      {communityPool.approved > 0 ? (
        <span class="cf-stat ok" title="人工审核已通过"><b>{communityPool.approved}</b> 已审核</span>
      ) : null}
      <span class="cf-note">独立数据源 · 池容量上限 500 · 与自动发现（150 条）互不影响</span>
    </div>

    {communityPool.recent.length > 0 ? (
      <div class="cf-row">
        {communityPool.recent.map(t => (
          <a class="cf-card" href={t.repo_url || `https://github.com/${t.repo_slug || ''}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <span class="cf-name">{esc(t.title || t.repo_slug || '')}</span>
            {t.description ? <span class="cf-desc">{esc(String(t.description).slice(0, 70))}</span> : null}
            <span class="cf-meta">
              <span class={`cf-status ${t.review_status === 'approved' ? 'ok' : 'pending'}`}>
                {t.review_status === 'approved' ? '已审核' : '待人工审核'}
              </span>
              <span class="cf-src">社区提交</span>
              {typeof t.stars === 'number' ? <span class="cf-stars">⭐ {fmtStars(t.stars)}</span> : null}
            </span>
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
    ) : (
      <div class="cf-empty">还没有社区提交 —— <a href={`/AI-Shovel-Collection/submit/?view=form`}>成为第一个推荐者 →</a></div>
    )}

    <div class="cf-actions">
      <a class="cf-btn primary" href={`/AI-Shovel-Collection/submit/?view=form`}>📝 提交新工具</a>
      <a class="cf-btn" href={`/AI-Shovel-Collection/submit/`}>📄 收录列表</a>
    </div>
  </section>
  </div><!-- /.home-feature-grid -->

  <noscript><div class="noscript-note">⚠️ 当前浏览器未启用 JavaScript：下方列表需 JS 渲染，请直接查看 <a href="https://github.com/manningyangs/AI-Shovel-Collection/blob/main/catalog.csv">catalog.csv</a>（191 条精选）或 <a href="live_multi.json">live_multi.json</a>（含候选与端点实测数据）。</div></noscript>
